-- title:
--   Original zero-jump positive stopped prepayment plus strict cash bound from one centred Gaussian Ito witness
-- statement:
--   For the exact original spectrally negative Levy process with X.nu=0, nonzero Gaussian variance and infinite admissible dividend cap, the discounted prepayment terminal reserve plus strictly-before-clock Stieltjes cash at each genuine bounded stopped clock is bounded almost surely by w(x) plus a single integrable centred Gaussian Ito martingale. Time-zero is masked. This source-to-payoff physical Ito estimate, together with source-proved endpoint comparison, implies parent 249c532d. No auxiliary general-jump martingales are required.
-- source:
--   Direct root-connected correction of parent 249c532d replacing overstrong selected afbeaf83→25573e81 general-jump route; uses parent exact hNuZero and positive ruin contact.

